## Design Decisions (unchanged)

- No hardcoded equipment limits — all thresholds user-configurable via Web UI
- `SAFETY_HUM_CEILING_HARD` at 95% is emergency brake only
- `NTFY_ENABLED` defaults to `false` (dormant until configured)
- `DEFAULT_HUM_EXHAUST_ON` defaults to 95% (dormant until lowered via Web UI)
- Alive pings fire 30 min after boot, include MAC address, 2000ms HTTP timeout
- Fridge alarms: 8°C high, 0°C low, 10-min cooldown, suppressed when heartbeat lost
- Fridge bridge: backward-compatible 8/13-byte packets, NAN for unknown humidity, door tri-state UI

